Third party notices

This package is a Dart port of the LZMA SDK 26.01 by Igor Pavlov
(https://www.7-zip.org/sdk.html), which is placed in the public domain:

  "LZMA SDK is written and placed in the public domain by Igor Pavlov.
  Anyone is free to copy, modify, publish, use, compile, sell, or distribute
  the original LZMA SDK code, either in source code form or as a compiled
  binary, for any purpose, commercial or non-commercial, and by any means."

Parts of the LZMA SDK are based on public domain code by other developers:
PPMd var.H (2001) by Dmitry Shkarin, and SHA-256 from the Crypto++ library
by Wei Dai.

Only the public domain LZMA SDK was used as a source. No code from the
GNU LGPL licensed parts of 7-Zip was used. 7-Zip is a registered trademark
of Igor Pavlov; this package is not affiliated with or endorsed by him.
